{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_026_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "722aebda10b32ce58a3e7b2a0a813a141038e609d732805bf2feb8a988ee32b5", "ja": "ふっふっふ……しほりん！\n今度の今度こそ、茜ちゃんが\nセンターになるのだー！", "zh": "哼哼哼……志保保！\n这一次小茜一定会坐上\nCenter的宝座──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_026_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "ccb9b0f3c931496915144d05122e2f8f75c33ae82868ff092eecd27c022483c9", "ja": "この前は、ゆずってあげたケド…\n次こそ茜ちゃんの番だよ！\nしほりんも、そう思うよね？", "zh": "之前让给你了……\n下一次就轮到小茜了！\n志保保，你也这么想吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_026_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "5b625f92305c90a202ee4bd31ae09ab1816c30f046f71e0fbb1eb506788d9ecc", "ja": "私に聞かれても、わかりません。\n{$P$}さんが\n決めることなので。", "zh": "你问我，我也不知道。\n这是由{$P$}先生\n决定的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_026_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "a720bc17d9fc8cb37558ea77e2e757d5407581b956516e1cb25cfeb1f5935bcc", "ja": "それに、私のセンターも、ゆずって\nもらったつもりはないです。", "zh": "况且，我并不认为我上次能担任Center\n是因为你的礼让。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_026_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "409e1e45ae05c30cce1d27083311883f0d220881a6676c67deb1052fb68d1240", "ja": "でも…茜さんなら、\nそろそろセンターに\n選ばれるんじゃないですか？", "zh": "不过……以茜的表现来看，\n也差不多该被选为Center了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_026_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "f0abeb393e407c4cc8dc81358a9dc9e8a77a093fb50bee67504567a8a19b7892", "ja": "えっ、今何て言ったの、しほりん！\n茜ちゃんが、次のセンターに\n絶対の絶対に間違いないって！？", "zh": "什么！？你刚刚说什么？志保保！？\n你说小茜百分百肯定就是\n下次的Center！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_026_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "1281101cea820cb96358729567d8cd1fd8940f483b2ee4804f805ddd6917d585", "ja": "いえ、絶対の絶対に\n間違いないとまでは……。", "zh": "不，\n我没有说得那么夸张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_026_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "8912913af7b4fb9c760fd18ba6f2a8ed92173bba9d2d467cbbae77e9c85aa700", "ja": "それならさっそく、\n準備しとかないとね！\n忙しくなるぞ～、やっふー！", "zh": "这样小茜就得赶快来准备了呢！\n要忙碌起来啰～呀呼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
